                <pb facs="0192" n="186" sameAs="frus:frus1894app1/pg186"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Bayard to Mr.
                            Gresham.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Embassy of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >London</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-04-30"><hi rendition="#italic">April 30,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>British minister for foreign affairs asks me to inform him exact term President’s
                    instructions authorizing British officers to arrest the United States vessels
                    contravening act of Congress as proclaimed.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
